{"speciesId":617,"names":{"fr":"Limaspeed","es":"Accelgor","en":"Accelgor","ja":"アギルダー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand son corps s’assèche, il faiblit. Il s’en prémunit en s’enroulant dans plusieurs couches d’une fine muqueuse."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When its body dries out, it weakens. So, to prevent dehydration, it wraps itself in many layers of thin membrane."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il s’est bien allégé en se débarrassant de sa lourde carapace. Il se bat avec l’agilité d’un ninja."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Having removed its heavy shell, it becomes very light and can fight with ninja-like movements."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When its body dries out, it weakens. So it wraps a membrane around itself for protection while it spits poison."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When its body dries out, it weakens. So it wraps a membrane around itself for protection while it spits poison."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il s’est bien allégé en se débarrassant de sa lourde carapace. Il se bat avec l’agilité d’un ninja."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se siente ligero una vez liberado de su caparazón. Lucha y se mueve como un ninja."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Having removed its heavy shell, it becomes very light and can fight with ninja-like movements."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"重い 殻を 脱いだために 身軽になった。まるで 忍者のような 身のこなしで 戦う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand son corps s’assèche, il faiblit. Il s’en prémunit en s’enroulant dans plusieurs couches d’une fine muqueuse."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Los ambientes secos lo debilitan. Evita la sequedad envolviéndose en muchas membranas finas superpuestas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When its body dries out, it weakens. So, to prevent dehydration, it wraps itself in many layers of thin membrane."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体が 乾くと 弱ってしまう。 薄い 膜を 何重も 巻いて 乾燥を 防いでいるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il s’est bien allégé en se débarrassant de sa lourde carapace. Il se bat avec l’agilité d’un ninja."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se siente ligero una vez liberado de su caparazón. Lucha y se mueve como un ninja."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Having removed its heavy shell, it becomes very light and can fight with ninja-like movements."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"重い 殻を 脱いだために 身軽になった。まるで 忍者のような 身のこなしで 戦う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quand son corps s’assèche, il faiblit. Il s’en prémunit en s’enroulant dans plusieurs couches d’une fine muqueuse."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Los ambientes secos lo debilitan. Evita la sequedad envolviéndose en muchas membranas finas superpuestas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When its body dries out, it weakens. So, to prevent dehydration, it wraps itself in many layers of thin membrane."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体が 乾くと 弱ってしまう。 薄い 膜を 何重も 巻いて 乾燥を 防いでいるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il se bat avec célérité en projetant du poison. Il est si cool qu’il est souvent le héros de films ou de bandes dessinées à succès."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Lucha escupiendo veneno y moviéndose a una velocidad de vértigo. Ha protagonizado películas y cómics de gran éxito."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It moves with blinding speed and lobs poison at foes. Featuring Accelgor as a main character is a surefire way to make a movie or comic popular."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"素早い 動きで 毒を 飛ばし 戦う。 アギルダーが 主役の 映画や マンガは 大人気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il est bien plus agile sans sa coquille. La membrane en forme de bandelettes qui l’entoure l’empêche de se dessécher."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Tras desha